{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32648","headline":"题郑中丞东溪 · 刘沧","name":"题郑中丞东溪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一境新开雉堞西，绿苔微径露凄凄。\n高轩夜静竹声远，曲岸春深杨柳低。\n山霁月明常此醉，草芳花暗省曾迷。\n即随凤诏归清列，几忆风花梦小溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32648.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32648","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}